      "id": "sol.amc-8-1990-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(0.48017\\) is close to \\(\\dfrac12\\), the product is close to\n\n\\[\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)^3 = \\dfrac18 = 0.125.\\]\n\nThe choice closest to \\(0.125\\) is \\(0.110\\).\n\nThus, the correct answer is B .",
